   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">搬家清单</text:h>
   <text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_2" text:outline-level="2"><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__8_3007488364" loext:parent-name="__Annotation__5_3007488364" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>小禾</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2026-10-16T08:30:00</dc:date>
     <meta:creator-initials>小</meta:creator-initials>
     <text:p>好，改成两句</text:p>
    </office:annotation><office:annotation office:name="__Annotation__5_3007488364" loext:resolved="false">
     <dc:creator>阿澄</dc:creator>
     <dc:date>2026-10-16T08:00:00</dc:date>
     <meta:creator-initials>阿</meta:creator-initials>
     <text:p>这句再短一点</text:p>
    </office:annotation>这个周末要把东西搬到新家，下面是我的安排。<office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__5_3007488364"/><office:annotation-end office:name="__Annotation__8_3007488364"/></text:h>
